.TH "libnvme_reread_partitions" 9 "libnvme_reread_partitions" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_reread_partitions \- Reread the partition table
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "int" libnvme_reread_partitions
.BI "(struct libnvme_transport_handle *hdl "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "hdl" 12
Transport handle
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Ask the kernel to reread the partition table of a namespace, e.g. after
the namespace has become readable again. This should only be used for
namespace handles, not controllers.
.SH "RETURN"
0 if the partition table was reread or a negative error code
otherwise.
